---
title: Checkout interaction
---
sequenceDiagram
	actor Customer
	participant Storefront
	participant Ordering
	participant Basket as Basket API
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant Finance
	participant Kafka
	participant Notification
	participant Outbox as Notification database
	participant SMTP as SMTP provider

	Customer ->> Storefront: Choose Checkout
	Storefront ->> Ordering: POST /ordering/api/v1/orders
	Ordering ->> Basket: GetBasketGrpc (persisted quantities)
	Basket -->> Ordering: Current basket
	Ordering ->> Catalog: GetBooksGrpc (current prices)
	Catalog -->> Ordering: Book details and prices
	Ordering ->> Ordering: Save New Order and item-price snapshot

	par HTTP confirmation
		Ordering -->> Storefront: 201 Created with Order ID
		Storefront -->> Customer: Show checkout confirmation
	and Asynchronous Finance workflow
		Ordering -->> Finance: UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent
		Finance ->> Finance: Start persisted saga
		Finance ->> Kafka: Publish PlaceOrderCommand
		Finance ->> Finance: Schedule 30-minute timeout

		par Basket cleanup consumer
			Kafka ->> Basket: PlaceOrderCommand
			Basket ->> Basket: Delete submitted basket

			alt Deletion returns true
				Basket -->> Finance: BasketDeletedCompleteIntegrationEvent
				Finance ->> Kafka: DeleteBasketCompleteCommand
				Kafka ->> Ordering: Log cleanup only
			else Deletion returns false
				Basket -->> Finance: BasketDeletedFailedIntegrationEvent
				Finance ->> Finance: Mark failure and finalize saga
				Finance ->> Kafka: DeleteBasketFailedCommand
				Kafka ->> Ordering: Soft-delete Order if present
				Note over Ordering: No Order status change or cancellation event
			end
		and Notification consumer
			Kafka ->> Notification: PlaceOrderCommand

			alt Recipient email is present
				Notification ->> Outbox: Save rendered email as unsent
				Notification ->> SMTP: Submit MIME message over SMTP

				alt Submission and sent-state save succeed
					SMTP -->> Notification: Submission accepted
					Notification ->> Outbox: Mark email sent
				else Submission or sent-state save fails
					Note over Notification,Outbox: Record may remain unsent, outcome can be uncertain
				end
			else Recipient email is absent
				Notification ->> Notification: Skip email work
			end
			Note over Notification,SMTP: SMTP acceptance is not inbox delivery
		and Finance timeout policy
			loop Timeout fires while saga is active (at most two reissues)
				Finance ->> Finance: Increment TimeoutRetryCount
				Finance ->> Kafka: Reissue PlaceOrderCommand
				Finance ->> Finance: Schedule next timeout
			end

			opt Retry limit reached
				Finance ->> Finance: Cancel and finalize the saga

				opt Name and email are present
					Finance ->> Kafka: CancelOrderCommand
					Kafka ->> Notification: Request cancellation email only
				end
				Note over Finance,Ordering: Saga cancellation does not cancel the Order
			end
		end
		Note over Basket,Notification: Consumers run independently, retries can repeat their work
	end
